    "title": "Lompoc Residents Invited to Enter 2025 Holiday Lights & Decoration Contest - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 minutes ago The Lompoc Beautification & Appearance Commission has opened nominations for the 2025 Holiday Lights & Decoration Contest in Lompoc, California. Residents and businesses within the city limits are invited to decorate their properties and submit nominations. The nomination period runs from November 17, 2025, to December 16, 2025, which is the judging day.\nThe commission will judge the entries. There are separate categories for residences and businesses. This year, the categories include A Shining Star, A Classic Christmas, A Coastal Christmas, A Space Age Christmas, and An Inflatable Christmas. Nominations and questions can be submitted by phone or email to the commission.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
